  "validation": [
    "Eight new physical scenarios and one imported Coarse regression pass in Cargo and warm-root Bazel; integrated Clippy passes.",
    "All generations installed unready; staging before writes; exact write receipts and verified reads before observations; actual typed walker closure plus independent expected edges.",
    "Checkpoint/read/replacement/late-write checks cover both physical algorithms and full identities. Source frozen before root integration."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Frozen candidate admission uses its SHA256 placeholder ActionKey and opaque qualified-action string; BLAKE3 coverage is physical storage/preparation/publication, not REAPI digest normalization.",
    "Local singleton outer commit counter is the fixture serving barrier; no Raft or provider read-barrier claim.",
    "Checkpoint recovery cuts occur after all local physical write functions returned. Missing observations are reconciled from exact reads and snapshot stable write identities; no remote writer quiescence claim.",
    "Known finite graphs independently provide conservative prewrite staging sets. Arbitrary untrusted RPC closure completeness is unqualified.",
    "No provider deletion, production activation, load/sizing or accepted-history feature composition claim.",
    "Focused Cargo/Clippy verification here; parent owns warm-root Bazel integration."
  ],
